    "body": "I think that's fine. This may require updating these definitions a bit:\r\n\r\nhttps://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#dom-cookieinit-expires - change the type\r\nhttps://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#dom-cookielistitem-expires - change the type\r\nhttps://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#as-a-timestamp - fine as is?\r\nhttps://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#date-serialize - just change the type name?\r\nhttps://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#delete-a-cookie - talks about \"earliest representable date\" ... probably still okay\r\n",
